{"job_id":"F-7f770a2c0c1257e41627","family_id":"F-7f770a2c0c1257e41627","title":"일본ㆍ중국 및 핀란드산 도공(Coated) 인쇄용지에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014631-261255-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":49,"target_id":"7846954c21e287f1efe24c318deb1e3a7574d5a56f5efcbaa2e57318c46d3591","source_hash":"1828caa83f96d630f1207bf8980eab92e9031fda5b49298b218a1b276d5bac83","text":"关于对日本、中国和芬兰产涂布印刷纸征收反倾销税的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014631-261255-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"577db33b16ceaae6bb74718f7dc47231223b6fe818a173dedb0b84078b51ad14","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014631-261255-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":336,"target_id":"256ff84b04720a4ab95b4d3e1579ddaaf7b224adf65613c7e9172a9a3818f8bf","source_hash":"de1b2ea265b84caef17c468fb4eb9f3a7cfe1c6f07a419ddad668160bf4d4a9c","text":"第二条（征税对象） 征反倾销税的对象为日本、中国和芬兰生产的涂布印刷纸（指海关法实施令第98条第1款规定的海关和统计协调制度税号4810.13.1000、4810.14.0000、4810.19.1000、4810.19.9000、4810.22.0000和4810.29.0000对应的印刷纸），其中每平方米重量超过55克但不超过11​​0克。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014631-261255-ko","scope":"BODY","start":336,"end":411,"target_id":"f1c25049ae7ea0561157db9acef616dd95d8ab451a987eeca16dc8fd1fc02861","source_hash":"2a9a883534d346b34789a4e35bdba50415b359f2b1157b2c69b6940aa7b3ebdb","text":"第三条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第二条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如下表所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014631-261255-ko","scope":"BODY","start":411,"end":434,"target_id":"f2be465dd54bcf3ea34bd635178bd90d92ece5174416492f4f519c8fc928d228","source_hash":"4cae718fb2c76d079d5b042ecb844aa44471577c778a7b2e73e992e139a3740a","text":"补充规定 <第1040号，2024年3月18日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014631-261255-ko","scope":"BODY","start":434,"end":464,"target_id":"d7ede